  "description" : "Death lurks behind a mysterious orphanage where children train to become magical weapons of war. Among them is http://anidb.net/ch146895 [Sheena], who longs to stop the fighting and end the conflict. On one gruesome night, Sheena meets a strange girl covered in blood, with a smile on her face. The mysterious girl turns out to be a secret weapon—an immortal child soldier named http://anidb.net/ch146894 [Mimi]. When the two become roommates, there is growing tension and attraction. How will the peace-loving Sheena live with someone who welcomes death?\nSource: Kodansha\nNote: The first episode received an advance release on Kadokawa`s YouTube channel on 21 June 2026. The regular TV broadcast started on 7 July 2026.",
